 "summary": "Requires the commissioner of education to establish and enforce rules and regulations to incorporate at least a three credit course devoted to the instructional techniques necessary for effective literacy instruction which shall include delivering structured, systematic, explicit, evidence-based instruction in reading, including but not limited to those incorporating multisensory instruction for current and prospective teachers.",
 "title": "Requires the incorporation of structured, explicit, language-based multisensory approaches to literacy instruction for current and prospective teachers",
